<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Jan 24, compared with the Jan 17 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.19 vs 5.19</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.04 vs 5.03</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.44 vs 5.47</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.33 vs 5.34</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.42 vs 5.44</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.44 vs 5.44</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.84 vs 6.81</p>
</text>
